{"id":"n3b03722fcc","headline":"HUDCO Plans Social Impact Bonds To Fund Urban Infrastructure Projects","summary":"HUDCO plans to launch social impact bonds later this year to fund projects linked to measurable social outcomes. The lender is exploring global markets, including the US, and aims to double its loan book to Rs 3 lakh crore by 2030.","why":"HUDCO is a government-owned Indian housing and urban infrastructure lender, and its bond issuance affects funding for state projects.","category":"companies","event_type":"capital","importance":1,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"New Delhi","country":"India","lat":28.61,"lon":77.21,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Free Press Journal","url":"https://www.freepressjournal.in/business/hudco-plans-social-impact-bonds-to-fund-urban-infrastructure-projects"},"sources":[{"name":"Free Press Journal","url":"https://www.freepressjournal.in/business/hudco-plans-social-impact-bonds-to-fund-urban-infrastructure-projects"}],"published_at":"2026-07-09T11:02:16Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T13:01:10Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"e9ae2f7b49f80362","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T13:01:10Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-07-09T11:02:16Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-07-09T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"JA","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/banknotes-money-3125467.jpg","alt":"banknotes money (illustration)","credit":"pasja1000","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/america-the-dollar-president-3125467/"}}